            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            tagline: 'Taroki z królami (Taroki call king) is a four-player Polish tarot game from Kozy near Bielsko Biała. Bidder calls a king for partner; 54-card pack, 22 trumps; win by taking more than half the card points.',
          },
          shortDescription: "Taroki z królami (Taroki call king) is a four-player Polish tarot game from Kozy near Bielsko Biała. Bidder chooses partner by calling a King (not the XIX). 54-card pack, 22 trumps; declarer's side wins by taking more than half the card points.",
